(7554036, 1210351, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge<br/> <br/>Ooh you little tinker, you threw me there, I thought whose this Phocal, it looks like serious competition to Ronnie! Who else could it be, it has all your hallmarks of a quality image except as you have already identified for yourself all of which I agree with, sharpness in the beak and prey that would have resulted from a smaller aperture would have made this a winner.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge Ooh you little tinker, you threw me there, I thought whose this Phocal, it looks like serious competition to Ronnie! Who else could it be, it has all your hallmarks of a quality image except as you have already identified for yourself all of which I agree with, sharpness in the beak and prey that would have resulted from a smaller aperture would have made this a winner.', '2018-01-23 15:00:36.000000', NULL, 0),
